{
  "id": "EXO.36",
  "number": "36",
  "bookId": "EXO",
  "reference": "Exodus 36",
  "verseCount": 38,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "36",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 36"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "36",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bezalel, Oholiab, and all the other workers to whom the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has given skill and understanding, who know how to make everything needed to build the sacred Tent, are to make everything just as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has commanded.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses called Bezalel, Oholiab, and all the other skilled men to whom the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had given ability and who were willing to help, and Moses told them to start working. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They received from him all the offerings which the Israelites had brought for constructing the sacred Tent. But the people of Israel continued to bring Moses their offerings every morning. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the skilled men who were doing the work went ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and reported to Moses, “The people are bringing more than is needed for the work which the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded to be done.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Moses sent a command throughout the camp that no one was to make any further contribution for the sacred Tent; so the people did not bring any more. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What had already been brought was more than enough to finish all the work.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The most skilled men among those doing the work made the Tent of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence. They made it out of ten pieces of fine linen woven with blue, purple, and red wool and embroidered with figures of winged creatures. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Each piece was the same size, twelve metres long and two metres wide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They sewed five of them together in one set and did the same with the other five. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made loops of blue cloth on the edge of the outside piece in each set. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They put fifty loops on the first piece of the first set and fifty loops matching them on the last piece of the second set. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made fifty gold hooks, with which to join the two sets into one piece.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they made a cover for the Tent out of eleven pieces of cloth made of goats' hair. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made them all the same size, thirteen metres long and two metres wide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They sewed five of them together in one set and the other six in another set. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They put fifty loops on the edge of the last piece of one set and fifty loops on the edge of the other set. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made fifty bronze hooks to join the two sets, so as to form one cover. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made two more coverings, one of rams' skin dyed red and the other of fine leather, to serve as an outer cover.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made upright frames of acacia wood for the Tent. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Each frame was four metres tall and 66 centimetres wide, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with two matching projections, so that the frames could be joined together. All the frames had these projections. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made twenty frames for the south side ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and forty silver bases to go under them, two bases under each frame to hold its two projections. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made twenty frames for the north side of the Tent ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and forty silver bases, two under each frame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the back of the Tent, on the west, they made six frames ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and two frames for the corners. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These corner frames were joined at the bottom and connected all the way to the top. The two frames that formed the two corners were made in this way. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So there were eight frames and sixteen silver bases, two under each frame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made fifteen crossbars of acacia wood, five for the frames on one side of the Tent, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "five for the frames on the other side, and five for the frames on the west end, at the back. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The middle crossbar, set halfway up the frames, extended from one end of the Tent to the other. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They covered the frames with gold and fitted them with gold rings to hold the crossbars, which were also covered with gold.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.34"
            ]
          }
        }
