          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They made a curtain of fine linen, woven with blue, purple, and red wool and embroidered it with figures of winged creatures. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
