          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For this curtain they made five posts fitted with hooks, covered their tops and their rods with gold, and made five bronze bases for the posts.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.38",
